# Keep text files LF everywhere (fixtures are hashed/compared byte-for-byte) and never touch binaries.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
